// PRD §7.4 Cut instead of delete: select a sentence → ⌘/ → it fades in place → ⌘/ inside puts it back.
{"keys": "cmd-d"}
{"select": "A week later you can't remember what they were, only that one of them was better."}
{"keys": "cmd-/"}
{"expect": {"ghosts": 1}}
{"wait": 400}
{"shot": "$OUT/flow4-a.png"}
{"select": {"text": "week", "at": "start"}}
{"keys": "cmd-/"}
{"expect": {"ghosts": 0}}
{"wait": 400}
{"shot": "$OUT/flow4-b.png"}
{"select": "A week later you can't remember what they were, only that one of them was better."}
{"keys": "cmd-/"}
{"expect": {"ghosts": 1}}
{"action": "app::Save"}
{"wait": 200}
